*.log
*.bak
.vscode/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# dev output of the font baker (large PNG previews)
ZeDUI/tools/fonts/preview_*.png
# pad map captures (large 4K PNGs, regenerated by zedqa_padmap.lua + padmap.py)
ZeDUI/qa/padmap/*.png
# bubble QA captures (4K PNGs, regenerated by zedqa_bubbles.lua); the contact sheet is kept
ZeDUI/qa/bubbles/zqa_*.png
# raw full-screen QA captures in any run folder (PNG frames named zqa_* / zedqa_* by getCore():TakeFullScreenshot in
# ZeDUI/tools/qa/zedqa_*.lua, regenerated by running the script again); the JPG crops, contact sheets and reports are kept
ZeDUI/qa/**/zqa_*.png
ZeDUI/qa/**/zedqa_*.png
# the dash builder's working output (build.py, export_lua.py and luatest.py write here)
ZeDUI/tools/dashpx/out/
# Python caches
__pycache__/
# local backup copies (fonts, a settings snapshot, a dump of the game's item list): kept out of the repo
zed_backups/
# the icon matcher's packs (Flaticon / Smashicons / UIcons sources, third-party pixel packs, the game's own icons):
# licensed, never in the repository (removed from the whole history Oct 28 2026); only the matcher's own scripts are tracked
ZeDUI/tools/icon_matcher/*/
ZeDUI/tools/icon_matcher/*.pdf
ZeDUI/tools/icon_matcher/*.html
ZeDUI/tools/icon_matcher/*.json
# physpx scratch export (platesame.py / export_phys.py default output)
ZeDUI/tools/physpx/out/
# gallery PNG masters (regenerated by spread.py and title_spread.py into out_spread/, by book_shots.py into out/ and
# out_book/); the upload/ JPGs, the cover, the thumbnails, extras/ and cinema/ are kept
ZeDUI/workshop/gallery/out_spread/
ZeDUI/workshop/gallery/out_book/
ZeDUI/workshop/gallery/out/
# thumb_px.py's scratch card (written beside it, removed after each run)
ZeDUI/workshop/gallery/_thumb_card.png

# local Claude Code files (settings, hookify rules, worktrees): never in the public repo (the director, Nov 9 2026)
.claude/
